  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">From conflict-affected populations to government institutions: bridging the legal services gap in Quissanga - Durable solutions to displaced communities in Northern Moz 
Outcome 1: Providing immediate support to vulnerable households by facilitating access to key documentation 
Outcome 2: An environment enabling durable solutions is generated, through support to restablish
Governmental ability to issue key documentation and autonomously respond to a primordial need in the community</narrative>
  </description>
